  "system": {
    "featureForm": "reaction",
    "description": "<p>When a PC within Close range targets the @Lookup[@name] with an attack, you can <strong>mark a Stress</strong> to attack the PC first. On a success, deal <strong>4d4+10</strong> physical damage and Poison them until their next rest or they succeed on a Knowledge Roll (20). While Poisoned, the target must roll a <strong>d6</strong> before they make an action roll. On a result of 3 or lower, they must mark a Stress.</p>",
